{"t": 1795091884.9374344, "tool": "analyze", "code": "best=[]\nbase=[np.ones_like(P),P,P**2,P**3,t,t*P]\nfor w in np.linspace(0.05,3,300):\n    X=np.column_stack(base+[np.sin(w*t),np.cos(w*t)])\n    c,_,_,_=np.linalg.lstsq(X,dP_dt,rcond=None)\n    r=np.sqrt(np.mean((X@c-dP_dt)**2))\n    best.append((r,w))\nbest.sort(); print(best[:5])\nX=np.column_stack(base); c,_,_,_=np.linalg.lstsq(X,dP_dt,rcond=None); print(np.sqrt(np.mean((X@c-dP_dt)**2)))", "out": "[(np.float64(0.3806484183680662), np.float64(0.05)), (np.float64(0.3806769298057839), np.float64(0.05986622073578596)), (np.float64(0.3807124383545404), np.float64(0.06973244147157191)), (np.float64(0.38075588759749496), np.float64(0.07959866220735787)), (np.float64(0.38080837696770675), np.float64(0.08946488294314381))]\n1.0280491728941312\n"}
