{"t": 1795091903.0751116, "tool": "analyze", "code": "Pb=[np.ones_like(P),P,P**2,P**3]\ndef test(tb,name):\n    cols=[f*p for f in tb for p in Pb]\n    X=np.column_stack(cols); c,_,_,_=np.linalg.lstsq(X,dP_dt,rcond=None)\n    print(name, np.sqrt(np.mean((X@c-dP_dt)**2)))\n    return c\ntest([np.ones_like(t),t,t**2],'poly2')\ntest([np.ones_like(t),t,t**2,t**3],'poly3')\ntest([np.ones_like(t),np.sqrt(t),t,t**2],'sqrt')\ntest([np.ones_like(t),np.log(t),t,t**2],'log')\ntest([np.ones_like(t),np.exp(-t/3),np.exp(-t/6),t],'exp')\ntest([np.ones_like(t),np.sin(t),np.cos(t),np.sin(2*t),np.cos(2*t),t],'trig')\nc=test([np.ones_like(t),np.exp(-t/4),t,np.exp(-t/1.5)],'exp2'); print(np.round(c,3))", "out": "poly2 0.25172236222121336\npoly3 0.023463688800855934\nsqrt 0.09891508616071293\nlog 0.12165713729824264\nexp 0.04837951484318178\ntrig 0.9471727462423485\nexp2 0.04512397752592794\n[ 1.5262e+01  3.7400e-01 -3.1900e-01 -5.7000e-02 -1.5509e+01 -6.4800e-01\n  1.6800e-01  5.3000e-02 -2.3900e-01  2.0000e-01 -5.0000e-03  1.0000e-03\n -5.1200e-01  2.8600e-01 -2.8000e-02  3.0000e-03]\n"}
